librustzcash 2026-10 cohort: manifests, toolchain and cargo configuration

Applies on top of 0002-memo.patch. Generated from the engine-port working tree at
a59b211 (make-celari-files.sh); the Rust changes that go with it are in
0004-ironwood-nu7.patch, and the two only build together.

- Zcash crates from crates.io (releases of 2026-10-21, NU6.2/NU6.3/NU7-aware) instead of
  ChainSafe/librustzcash-nu61 feat/snap-nu61 (NU6.1, yanked pre-NU6.2 orchard 0.12):
  zcash_client_backend 0.25.0, zcash_primitives 0.31.0, zcash_keys 0.17.0,
  zcash_protocol 0.11.0, pczt 0.10.0, zip321 0.10.0, zcash_transparent 0.11.0,
  zcash_address 0.14.0, orchard 0.16, sapling-crypto 0.9, zip32 0.3.
- zcash_client_memory from ../engine/zcash_client_memory (Celari's ported backend, a
  sibling of the .webzjs/ checkout) instead of the fork.
- wasm-bindgen 0.2.129 (js-sys/web-sys 0.3.106, wasm-bindgen-futures 0.4.79,
  wasm-bindgen-test 0.3.79) instead of ChainSafe's 0.2.100 pin, and
  tonic-web-wasm-client 0.9.2: 0.8.0 never hands the gRPC-web grpc-status trailer to
  tonic, and tonic 0.14.8 fails every call without it. The 0.2.100 pin exists for the
  MetaMask Snap sandbox, which Celari does not use.
- rust-toolchain.toml: nightly-2026-10-28.
- .cargo/config.toml: the shared-memory linker flags that rustc no longer derives from
  +atomics (without them the module gets an unshared memory and threads break), and
  --cfg getrandom_backend="wasm_js" for getrandom 0.4.
- getrandom 0.4 (wasm_js) and rand 0.10 (SysRng) as direct dependencies.
- webzjs-wallet [dev-dependencies] for its native tests (zcash_client_backend and
  zcash_client_memory with test-dependencies, http-body, tokio, zcash_transparent,
  incrementalmerkletree with legacy-api); the lockfile gains 23 test-only packages for
  them, none of which the wasm build compiles.
- webzjs-wallet depends on http-body 1 directly (already in the tree through tonic): the
  sync pass counts the bytes of each batch download (review round 5, M1).

No Cargo.lock hunk: the whole lockfile is engine/webzjs.Cargo.lock, which
scripts/build-webzjs.sh copies into .webzjs/ before building with --locked.

